  "subject": "a white campus food-delivery robot, unit three, that gets stuck on the same five-centimetre kerb outside the engineering building every lunchtime, and the students in department jackets who form a chanting cheer squad to lift its front wheels and push it over while the spicy pork rice bowls are still warm",
  "caption": "K-pop techno in the 2026 idol style, a driving club track with a cool, half-spoken girl-group topline. A pounding four-on-the-floor 909 kick; a squelching 303 acid bassline that opens its filter into the chorus; rolling off-beat open hi-hats with a clap on two and four; stabbing minor-key rave synth chords; a metallic arcade-style bleep sequence answering the vocal lines. Dark warehouse mix, kick and acid line forward, dry vocal with a short slapback delay. Female mid-range voice, cool and talky in the verses, shouted unison chorus. 140 BPM, F minor. Breathless, cheeky and rowdy. No trap hi-hats, no EDM festival drop, no autotune, no rap verse, no dubstep wobble.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - pounding kick and acid bassline]\n\n[Verse 1]\n열두 시 반, 제이공학관 앞\n하얀 배달 로봇 삼 호\n제육덮밥 싣고 오다가\n또 그 턱에 걸렸어\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n바퀴는 헛돌고 눈은 깜빡깜빡\n\"잠시만 기다려 주세요\"\n\n[Chorus - unison group shout]\n하나 둘 셋, 영차 영차\n앞바퀴 들어, 뒤에서 밀어\n덜컹 넘어간다, 삼 호야\n점심마다 우리가 밀어\n\n[Verse 2]\n과잠 입은 애들이 모여\n커피 들고 구경 와\n누구는 폰으로 찍고\n누구는 박자 맞춰 박수 쳐\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n오 센티 턱 하나 고쳐 달라고\n민원 넣은 지 벌써 한 달\n\n[Chorus - unison group shout]\n하나 둘 셋, 영차 영차\n기계과는 들고, 전자과는 밀어\n덜컹 넘어간다, 삼 호야\n제육덮밥 아직 따뜻해\n\n[Bridge - claps and chant over kick only]\n삼 호! 삼 호! 조금만 더!\n삼 호! 삼 호! 넘어가자!\n\n[Outro - acid line filters down]\n\"감사합니다\" 하고 쌩하니 가 버렸어\n내일 열두 시 반에 또 봐",
